  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Stitches\" was found abandoned as a duckling near the ruins of the 'Last Sip' bar, clutching a crudely sewn duck doll. Locals whisper that he's haunted by the ghosts of past patrons, fueling his strange obsession with vigilante-style justice.",
    "class": "Vigilante",
    "name": "Stitches",
    "personality": "Brooding: Stitches rarely speaks, preferring to communicate through menacing glares and the occasional well-placed squeak of his vice-grip beak. Obsessive: He's consumed by a need to 'right wrongs,' even if those wrongs are just someone hoarding extra DRIP. Unnerving: Stitches has a knack for appearing out of the shadows, his Vyezeen eyes unsettling even the most hardened Subchain City residents.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "\"Vice Grip Justice\": Stitches can temporarily clamp his beak onto an enemy, disabling their special ability and dealing minor sustained damage. The victim also gets 'the fear'.",
